---
// Data Security section
---

<section class="section data-security" id="security">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="security-header">
      <div class="feature-kicker">Your data is protected</div>
      <h2>Built for healthcare practices with privacy at the core.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="security-grid-list">
      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M12 2L3 7v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V7l-9-5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>No raw patient data stored</h3>
          <p>Dashboard snapshots contain only aggregated counts and totals — never individual patient information.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>Row Level Security</h3>
          <p>Each client's data is isolated at the database level — no practice can access another's information.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M4 10h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M9 14h2M9 17h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>Secure secret storage</h3>
          <p>Production secrets are stored in Vercel environment variables, never committed to code repositories.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>Read-only API access</h3>
          <p>We never modify your practice or ad data — Octavise only reads to generate insights and reports.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M8 12h8M12 8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>Encrypted in transit</h3>
          <p>HTTPS everywhere — all data transfers between your systems and Octavise are encrypted end-to-end.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="security-item">
        <div class="security-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="security-content">
          <h3>Login-protected dashboard</h3>
          <p>No public access to client data — every dashboard requires authentication to view practice information.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
